    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sami is a 2D platformer fantasy adventure that combines narrative storytelling, meditative puzzles, and exploration to create an immersive experience centered on emotional well-being and mindfulness. Players will embark on a journey alongside Sunu, as he navigates different worlds, each rich with its own challenges and symbolism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/5a286b0bb274cbde0416a02e132325bb.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=684 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/5a286b0bb274cbde0416a02e132325bb.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/5a286b0bb274cbde0416a02e132325bb.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sami is not just about overcoming obstacles\u2014it's about reflection, transformation, and self-discovery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/93ddea7270c3f9952f14be75335f1246.webp?t=1746554223\" width=227 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sunu, an ancestral oniric being in search of spiritual evolution. He travels through surreal environments where light and shadow constantly vie for dominance, reflecting his internal struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/e56fb2d0a37df243e36fab3bcf5358b0.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/e56fb2d0a37df243e36fab3bcf5358b0.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/e56fb2d0a37df243e36fab3bcf5358b0.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative is designed to provoke deep thoughts and personal reflection, encouraging players to question their own emotions and inner conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/a0a1f868aa1ac98ad7adfab1a4edb3a3.webp?t=1746554223\" width=227 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Sunu must aid lost souls, guiding them back to the right path while also grappling with his own doubts and fears. You get to use a set of special abilities, like the Ohm, to collect yout inner peace to transform everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/48e50b097b5c14df209a9637d700bba9.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/48e50b097b5c14df209a9637d700bba9.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/48e50b097b5c14df209a9637d700bba9.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/ee01fc26b09d309ff1e925789133d8bb.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/ee01fc26b09d309ff1e925789133d8bb.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/ee01fc26b09d309ff1e925789133d8bb.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/7d4d93a0a5f510499c8905a4338bab7a.webp?t=1746554223\" width=227 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game levels are inspired by the different phases of mental health, divided in 6 magical worlds with unique visual aesthetics. Explore each level while transforming misguided souls, invoke guardians powers and boosters, and solve meditative puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/0c4fadaa783280f11bdf7224d11982cb.avif?t=1746554223\" width=450 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/aae7c754e60f5cc2269c804c969ed181.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/aae7c754e60f5cc2269c804c969ed181.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/aae7c754e60f5cc2269c804c969ed181.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/0b4816c405ae74eff6196ec41ce2ef49.webp?t=1746554223\" width=200 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sami is a 2D platformer fantasy adventure that combines narrative storytelling, meditative puzzles, and exploration to create an immersive experience centered on emotional well-being and mindfulness. Players will embark on a journey alongside Sunu, as he navigates different worlds, each rich with its own challenges and symbolism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/5a286b0bb274cbde0416a02e132325bb.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=684 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/5a286b0bb274cbde0416a02e132325bb.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/5a286b0bb274cbde0416a02e132325bb.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sami is not just about overcoming obstacles\u2014it's about reflection, transformation, and self-discovery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/93ddea7270c3f9952f14be75335f1246.webp?t=1746554223\" width=227 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sunu, an ancestral oniric being in search of spiritual evolution. He travels through surreal environments where light and shadow constantly vie for dominance, reflecting his internal struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/e56fb2d0a37df243e36fab3bcf5358b0.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/e56fb2d0a37df243e36fab3bcf5358b0.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/e56fb2d0a37df243e36fab3bcf5358b0.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative is designed to provoke deep thoughts and personal reflection, encouraging players to question their own emotions and inner conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/a0a1f868aa1ac98ad7adfab1a4edb3a3.webp?t=1746554223\" width=227 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Sunu must aid lost souls, guiding them back to the right path while also grappling with his own doubts and fears. You get to use a set of special abilities, like the Ohm, to collect yout inner peace to transform everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/48e50b097b5c14df209a9637d700bba9.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/48e50b097b5c14df209a9637d700bba9.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/48e50b097b5c14df209a9637d700bba9.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/ee01fc26b09d309ff1e925789133d8bb.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/ee01fc26b09d309ff1e925789133d8bb.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/ee01fc26b09d309ff1e925789133d8bb.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/7d4d93a0a5f510499c8905a4338bab7a.webp?t=1746554223\" width=227 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game levels are inspired by the different phases of mental health, divided in 6 magical worlds with unique visual aesthetics. Explore each level while transforming misguided souls, invoke guardians powers and boosters, and solve meditative puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/0c4fadaa783280f11bdf7224d11982cb.avif?t=1746554223\" width=450 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/aae7c754e60f5cc2269c804c969ed181.poster.avif?t=1746554223\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/aae7c754e60f5cc2269c804c969ed181.webm?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/aae7c754e60f5cc2269c804c969ed181.mp4?t=1746554223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358740/extras/0b4816c405ae74eff6196ec41ce2ef49.webp?t=1746554223\" width=200 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
